  m_text: "To move your character, press <color=#FFCC00><b>A</b></color> to go left
    and <color=#FFCC00><b>D</b></color> to go right. \n\nTo jump, press <color=#FFCC00><b>W</b></color>.\n\nTo
    roll, move with <color=#FFCC00><b>A/D</b></color>, then press <color=#FFCC00><b>S</b></color>
    (only while moving).\n\n<size=80%><i>Note: Rolling can't be unlocked in Story
    Mode, only in later levels.</i></size>\n\nTo attack, press <color=#FFCC00>F </color>to
    attack horizontal and for vertical press <color=#FFCC00>G</color>.\n\nIf you
    want more info on multiplayer, \ncheck out the <b>Local Multiplayer</b> tab!"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
